{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just arrived in a new country and taken your first job at your uncle\u2019s d\u00f6ner shop. The problem? You don\u2019t speak the language. Every customer points to the menu to tell you what they want\u2014and it\u2019s up to you to decode their order before the rush gets out of hand. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914500/extras/c9dc1fff269cbd3c1efce786b0f86e85.poster.avif?t=1758831326\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914500/extras/c9dc1fff269cbd3c1efce786b0f86e85.webm?t=1758831326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the order is clear, the kitchen demands speed and precision. With no mouse controls\u2014only fast, fluid keyboard input\u2014you\u2019ll slice meat, stack ingredients, and wrap orders under pressure. Inspired by <i>Cook, Serve, Delicious!</i> but built around urgency and communication barriers, every shift feels like a test of focus and reflex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914500/extras/e6810b4e890a621461f42648b428cf29.poster.avif?t=1758831326\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914500/extras/e6810b4e890a621461f42648b428cf29.webm?t=1758831326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between shifts, choose how to spend your limited free time. Learn the language, make new friends, or shop for supplies. These choices shape your abilities, giving you buffs that carry back into the next day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique order system: customers point at the menu, you interpret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced cooking gameplay with pure keyboard controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of randomized customer appearances for variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After-work progression: study, socialize, or shop to earn buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A personal story about finding your footing in a new country.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914500?t=1758831326","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914500?t=1758831326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914500/aff5091c358a114c795b3834b3ece38991c216b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758831326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914500/aff5091c358a114c795b3834b3ece38991c216b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758831326","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just arrived in a new country and taken your first job at your uncle\u2019s d\u00f6ner shop. The problem? You don\u2019t speak the language. Every customer points to the menu to tell you what they want\u2014and it\u2019s up to you to decode their order before the rush gets out of hand. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914500/extras/c9dc1fff269cbd3c1efce786b